&lt;p style="text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp030000-asr_E37987-000:RiskManagementTextBlock>
  <jpcrp030000-asr_E37987-000:MetricsAndTargetsTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 36px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;(4）指標及び目標&lt;/p&gt;
